msgid "Heat"
msgstr ""

#: game/content/tips.gd:24
msgid "Heat makes every run harder: bigger targets, fewer placements, Mk II bosses. Each Heat you win unlocks the next."
msgstr ""

#: game/content/tips.gd:25
msgid "The Toybox"
msgstr ""

#: game/content/tips.gd:26
msgid "Spend Credits here. Jokers score for you every placement, items are one-use tools, and Workshop cards change the pieces in your bag."
msgstr ""

#: game/content/tips.gd:27
msgid "Interest"
msgstr ""

#: game/content/tips.gd:28
msgid "Unspent Credits earn interest after each round: +1 for every 5 you hold, up to +5 (less at Heat 3+). Saving can pay off."
msgstr ""

#: game/content/tips.gd:29
msgid "Choose the next round"
